OL,3,A'We only had a few seconds to save
OL,4,Apassengers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of a train where a knifeman
OL,7,Ftried to kill 10 people has recalled
OL,8,Ftrying to "stay calm" as he helped save
OL,9,Fthe lives of the 155 passengers on
OL,10,Fboard.
OL,12,FAndrew Johnson was driving the
OL,13,FLondon-bound LNER service on 1 November
OL,14,Flast year when Anthony Williams began
OL,15,Fhis attack.
OL,17,FWilliams's trial heard Johnson diverted
OL,18,Fthe train off the fast track to a slow
OL,19,Ftrack in order to make the unscheduled
OL,20,Fstop at Huntingdon in Cambridgeshire.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
