OL,3,AHundreds of thousands still without
OL,4,Apower after storms hit US on
OL,5,AThanksgiving
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of people are
OL,8,Fwithout power after severe weather hit
OL,9,Fboth coasts of the United States during
OL,10,Fthe Thanksgiving holiday.
OL,12,FEastern areas were lashed on Thursday
OL,13,Fby a powerful storm which brought high
OL,14,Fwinds, heavy rain and coastal flooding.
OL,15,FPennsylvania remained the state worst
OL,16,Fhit by power cuts early on Friday,
OL,17,Faccording to monitoring site
OL,18,FPoweroutage.us.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
