OL,3,AItaly's former police chief rejected
OL,4,Amafia inquiry allegations before death
OL,5,
OL,6,FItalian ex-police chief Gianni De
OL,7,FGennaro has denied misleading
OL,8,Finvestigations into high-profile Mafia
OL,9,Fkillings, in a letter written shortly
OL,10,Fbefore his death.
OL,12,FHis body was found at his Tuscan
OL,13,Fcountry home on Saturday and Italian
OL,14,Fauthorities believe he took his own
OL,15,Flife. A post mortem examination was due
OL,16,Fto take place on Friday.
OL,18,FIn his eight-page note, De Gennaro, 78,
OL,19,Fvehemently denied obstructing the
OL,20,Finquiry into the murder of anti-mafia
OL,21,Fjudge Paolo Borsellino in Sicily in
OL,22,FJuly 1992.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
